{
  "$comment": "Share links and anonymous payloads (SEC-DESIGN.md 5.2.9, 6.3; DESIGN.md 3.8). Tokens: new ones are `e` + 8 lowercase hex expiry (unix seconds) + 32 lowercase alphanumerics; legacy ones are 32 lowercase alphanumerics; slug links are not tokens and never expire (CTO-22). `outcomes` apply shareLinkOutcome(link, now, config); an expired link answers 410 LINK_EXPIRED on read and submit before any payload is built. `payloads` are the anonymous form payloads of document-form-builders-by-slug and v1/master-share public|invite: hidden fields are absent, secret fields carry is_secret true and no value, all 7 element types.",
  "contract": "share-link",
  "version": 1,
  "now": 1800000000,
  "regex": {
    "v2": "^e[0-9a-f]{8}[a-z0-9]{32}$",
    "legacy": "^[a-z0-9]{32}$"
  },
